    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41225" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσωτρον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Poll.
			1.144
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>, 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσσωτρον</span></b>  (as always in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>), τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>metal hoop upon the felloe</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶτρον</span>), <i>tire</i> of a wheel, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.519
			</span></i>: mostly in pl., <i><span class="en">
				5.725
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.537
			</span></i>, al.:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπίσσωτρον</span>
			is v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
